                "eng": "Arusu, a young girl who is transported to the Magical Realm and becomes a trainee witch. Her belief in using magic for good clashes with the other witches' more rigid and selfish ways, leading her to try and change their world. The season involves her learning to control her powers while navigating a conflict with the Warlock Realm and the threat of \"dark magic,\" which ultimately requires her to embrace the \"magic of light\" to save the realm.",
                "jpn": null
